        {
          "settings": {
            "handlerType": "Tool",
            "resourceUri": "",
            "handlerName": "decide_review_case",
            "handlerDescription": "Record the reviewer's decision on a case in their team queue - only after the reviewer explicitly confirmed the restated decision. decision is APPROVE or REJECT; amount is the approved compensation in dollars (empty = the full claimable amount; ignored for REJECT); internal_note is required (at least 5 characters, never shown to the recipient); customer_message is what the recipient will see. Approving a claim pays the compensation through the system's checks. Returns APPROVED / REJECTED with executed_action, or BLOCKED with reason_code NOT_YOUR_TEAM, ALREADY_DECIDED, NOTE_REQUIRED, AMOUNT_INVALID, OVER_AUTHORITY (case stays open for a senior reviewer), INVALID_DECISION or NOT_FOUND, or NOT_REVIEWER.",
            "toolTitle": "",
