    {
      "id": "flow:open_service_case_flow",
      "data": {
        "name": "open_service_case_flow",
        "description": "Hand a request that needs a human to the right team (for compensation claims on a damaged, lost or incomplete parcel use open_damage_claim instead): LOST_PARCEL (a parcel that never arrived), DAMAGED_PARCEL (arrived damaged), MISSING_ITEMS (contents missing from the parcel), WRONG_DELIVERY (delivered to the wrong place/person), DELIVERY_COMPLAINT (a complaint about the service) or OTHER. The system routes it and returns CASE_OPENED with case_id, team and reply time. The assistant never decides, promises or predicts compensation or outcomes.",
